WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.955
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.225 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.825 --> 01:37.745
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.105 --> 01:45.265
My Lady, you've only been married a few days,

5
01:45.345 --> 01:46.785
and your dowry attendant is already dead.

6
01:46.865 --> 01:50.785
People who don't know the truth may blame you for her death.

7
01:50.865 --> 01:52.585
What do we do now?

8
01:54.625 --> 01:55.705
My Lady.

9
01:56.745 --> 01:57.745
What brings you here, My Lord?

10
01:57.825 --> 01:59.025
You could've sent word through me.

11
01:59.105 --> 02:00.745
There was no need to come yourself.

12
02:00.825 --> 02:03.145
I remembered something important I need to tell her myself.

13
02:03.225 --> 02:04.665
Madam, His Lordship is here.

14
02:08.065 --> 02:11.425
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

15
02:14.505 --> 02:15.585
Open the door at once.

16
02:16.185 --> 02:17.265
-No. -My Lady.

17
02:18.545 --> 02:19.905
We can't let her die here.

18
02:20.985 --> 02:22.185
Put her on the bed.

19
02:22.265 --> 02:23.785
Draw the curtains. Hurry!

20
02:32.345 --> 02:33.265
My Lord.

21
02:34.865 --> 02:38.545
My Lord, My Lady took her medicine and just went to bed.

22
02:45.305 --> 02:48.185
I need to speak with her. Leave us.

23
02:49.665 --> 02:50.545
My Lord.

24
02:50.625 --> 02:52.145
My Lady was in terrible pain last night.

25
02:52.225 --> 02:53.585
She couldn't sleep all night.

26
02:53.665 --> 02:55.065
She only just fell asleep.

27
02:55.585 --> 02:56.665
Move.

28
02:57.665 --> 02:59.425
My Lord. My Lord!

29
03:54.105 --> 03:56.505
My Lord, why did you come to see me?

30
04:01.225 --> 04:04.105
There's something I forgot to tell you.

31
04:05.185 --> 04:06.185
What is it?

32
04:26.225 --> 04:28.265
I failed to put the brocade away properly earlier

33
04:28.945 --> 04:30.385
and nearly startled you.

34
04:30.465 --> 04:32.545
Please forgive me, My Lord, My Lady.

35
04:39.025 --> 04:40.105
Grandmother said

36
04:40.945 --> 04:43.585
the Wei family gave you many rare fabrics from the palace

37
04:44.225 --> 04:45.345
that can't be found anywhere else.

38
04:46.865 --> 04:48.065
I'd like to see them for myself.

39
04:58.505 --> 05:01.225
My Lord, the wardrobe was just searched.

40
05:01.305 --> 05:02.225
It's quite a mess.

41
05:02.305 --> 05:03.545
My Lord.

42
05:04.385 --> 05:05.705
My Lord.

43
05:07.505 --> 05:08.545
Let him look!

44
05:14.105 --> 05:18.065
I once gave my heart to you, My Lord, mand foolishly made a mistake.

45
05:18.905 --> 05:22.505
Since then, you've loathed me and always guarded against me.

46
05:23.145 --> 05:26.265
I admired you, My Lord, as a man who always keeps his word.

47
05:27.145 --> 05:29.625
I vowed to keep my promise and change my ways.

48
05:30.665 --> 05:34.305
But you, My Lord, still see me as a scheming thief.

49
05:35.105 --> 05:36.585
Now I don't know what you suspect me of.

50
05:37.505 --> 05:39.505
You barge into my room in broad daylight,

51
05:39.585 --> 05:41.585
suspecting me and searching everywhere.

52
05:41.665 --> 05:42.585
Go ahead. Search all you want!

53
05:43.545 --> 05:45.945
After all, I'm just someone you despise, someone who means nothing to you,

54
05:47.265 --> 05:49.345
not even worthy of your respect.

55
05:54.425 --> 05:55.465
That's not what I meant.

56
05:58.985 --> 06:00.185
I was just curious.

57
06:00.265 --> 06:02.265
I had my maid find the bridal booklet.

58
06:02.985 --> 06:04.985
She left my undergarments in quite a mess.

59
06:05.625 --> 06:06.625
I hid it because I feared it looked improper.

60
06:06.705 --> 06:07.785
That's why I kept it private.

61
06:09.305 --> 06:11.105
There's more than a bridal booklet in there.

62
06:12.505 --> 06:14.065
There are also intimate wedding charms.

63
06:15.065 --> 06:18.385
If you want to look, then take a good look at everything.

64
06:18.465 --> 06:21.185
If you don't look closely today, and want another look tomorrow,

65
06:21.825 --> 06:23.345
I may not even let you through the door!

66
06:25.985 --> 06:29.025
BLISSFUL UNION

67
06:35.265 --> 06:36.425
Who knew you would…

68
06:39.065 --> 06:40.625
A lady should conduct herself properly.

69
06:40.705 --> 06:42.465
It's broad daylight. Behave yourself.

70
06:43.065 --> 06:43.985
What if someone saw you?

71
06:44.505 --> 06:45.505
It would be scandalous.

72
06:47.745 --> 06:48.905
Fine. I won't look.

73
06:51.545 --> 06:52.385
Stop!

74
06:58.265 --> 07:00.465
-You… -What did you really come here for?

75
07:03.185 --> 07:05.305
Even when sleeping alone,

76
07:05.385 --> 07:07.185
you should stay properly dressed and composed.

77
07:07.265 --> 07:09.865
I came to tell you about the Lu family's past,

78
07:09.945 --> 07:11.305
so you wouldn't give yourself away in public.

79
07:11.905 --> 07:13.665
But now isn't a good time. We'll talk another day.

80
07:26.345 --> 07:27.345
Well done.

81
07:28.305 --> 07:31.025
My Lord. Didn't you say you had something important to discuss?

82
07:31.105 --> 07:32.745
Why are you leaving as soon as you arrived?

83
07:32.825 --> 07:36.225
After making this trip for nothing, Governess Miao will give me an earful.

84
07:38.585 --> 07:40.665
BLISSFUL UNION

85
07:40.745 --> 07:41.785
What kind of coin is this?

86
07:41.865 --> 07:43.585
How come I've never seen one before?

87
07:46.905 --> 07:47.865
Aren't you leaving?

88
07:49.185 --> 07:50.025
I am.

89
07:54.665 --> 07:56.105
Here, My Lord. Let me give you a hand.

90
08:04.225 --> 08:06.865
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

91
08:15.745 --> 08:16.825
You're on duty tonight?

92
08:16.905 --> 08:17.865
Yes.

93
08:18.385 --> 08:19.905
Governess Wu hasn't been seen since this afternoon.

94
08:19.985 --> 08:21.465
My Lady is angry.

95
08:21.545 --> 08:23.145
She ordered you to find her at once.

96
08:23.225 --> 08:24.065
Yes.

97
08:27.145 --> 08:28.825
Governess Wu often drinks too much

98
08:28.905 --> 08:30.825
and sleeps it off somewhere cool in the garden.

99
08:31.385 --> 08:33.865
Wake every maid and servant on duty tonight.

100
08:33.945 --> 08:36.345
Search the rockery, bushes, and pavilions.

101
08:36.425 --> 08:37.664
Take lanterns and search every corner.

102
08:37.745 --> 08:38.904
Go quietly.

103
08:38.985 --> 08:40.664
Don't alert the front courtyard.

104
08:40.745 --> 08:43.745
If Governess Miao finds out, someone's bound to be punished.

105
08:44.345 --> 08:45.385
-Yes. -Yes.

106
08:46.505 --> 08:50.425
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

107
09:01.425 --> 09:03.345
My Lady, I've sent them all away.

108
09:04.865 --> 09:07.785
I've tried again and again to stop you, but you just won't listen.

109
09:08.665 --> 09:10.545
If you keep putting your health at risk like this,

110
09:11.145 --> 09:12.185
I won't keep it secret anymore.

111
09:12.265 --> 09:13.705
I'll tell the Dowager Lady everything myself

112
09:13.785 --> 09:15.505
and take 40 strokes as punishment.

113
09:15.585 --> 09:17.785
Anything's better than living in fear every day.

114
09:23.705 --> 09:24.665
Let him look!

115
09:28.705 --> 09:29.865
Something's definitely wrong.

116
09:30.585 --> 09:31.505
Help me up.

117
09:33.065 --> 09:34.225
Don't alert anyone.

118
09:43.985 --> 09:45.025
My Lord.

119
09:45.105 --> 09:47.025
That looks like Bitao, the lady's maid.

120
09:47.105 --> 09:49.145
The woods out back are always deserted.

121
09:49.225 --> 09:50.665
The maids and servants rarely go there.

122
09:51.905 --> 09:52.745
Follow her.

123
10:02.345 --> 10:03.425
Did you bring everything?

124
10:03.505 --> 10:04.505
Yes.

125
10:25.025 --> 10:26.065
LU ZHUO'S BIRTH DETAILS

126
10:26.145 --> 10:29.265
Will this really work?

127
10:29.345 --> 10:30.425
Back in my hometown,

128
10:30.505 --> 10:33.025
when a marriage is troubled,

129
10:33.625 --> 10:35.425
all you need is a lock of the wife's hair.

130
10:35.505 --> 10:37.865
Tie it around both birth charts and burn them.

131
10:37.945 --> 10:40.225
It'll bind their fates together for life.

132
10:40.305 --> 10:42.345
Nothing will ever break that bond.

133
10:43.905 --> 10:44.785
Rest assured, My Lady.

134
10:44.865 --> 10:47.225
This ritual never fails.

135
10:47.305 --> 10:50.625
You and His Lordship will live in perfect harmony,

136
10:50.705 --> 10:51.705
loving and devoted to each other.

137
11:04.505 --> 11:06.065
She's really that devoted to me?

138
11:06.945 --> 11:08.785
She still hasn't given up.

139
11:11.305 --> 11:13.505
-Are you coming? -Coming.

140
11:19.745 --> 11:21.585
The lady truly loves you deeply.

141
11:21.665 --> 11:23.745
She's even resorted to some old folk ritual.

142
11:24.665 --> 11:26.945
In my humble opinion, back at the Princess's Residence,

143
11:27.465 --> 11:29.145
maybe she just lost her head for a moment.

144
11:30.345 --> 11:34.145
Given how deeply she loves you, perhaps you could forgive her a little.

145
11:34.225 --> 11:35.545
Want to lose your tongue?

146
11:38.505 --> 11:40.265
Does love excuse trying to kill someone?

147
11:40.785 --> 11:42.905
That kind of love is twisted and terrifying.

148
11:43.425 --> 11:44.385
I want no part of it.

149
11:49.905 --> 11:53.425
Tell Governess Miao tomorrow to post more guards at night,

150
11:53.985 --> 11:54.985
so she doesn't wander around

151
11:56.545 --> 11:57.865
and catch a chill.

152
11:58.465 --> 11:59.625
Then she'll blame the Lu family for mistreating her.

153
12:00.505 --> 12:01.385
Yes.

154
12:19.425 --> 12:21.025
My Lady, they're gone.

155
12:21.545 --> 12:23.185
How did you know His Lordship would come?

156
12:23.785 --> 12:26.225
He was awfully suspicious earlier today.

157
12:26.305 --> 12:28.545
I was just being safe. Let's do it.

158
12:59.465 --> 13:02.145
Don't worry, My Lady. Guanzhu told me

159
13:02.225 --> 13:04.665
a maid once quarreled with the housekeeper.

160
13:04.745 --> 13:06.745
In a fit of anger, she threw herself into the well.

161
13:06.825 --> 13:08.545
Servants have been forbidden from coming here ever since.

162
13:09.665 --> 13:11.265
Governess Wu was determined to harm me,

163
13:11.945 --> 13:14.545
yet I have to cover for her and the Wei family.

164
13:15.545 --> 13:18.745
Otherwise, once the truth comes out, I'll be held responsible too.

165
13:19.785 --> 13:21.625
I was reckless and caused all this trouble.

166
13:21.705 --> 13:23.785
I owe you my life, My Lady.

167
13:26.865 --> 13:28.745
She brought this on herself.

168
13:28.825 --> 13:29.825
You shouldn't have to die with her.

169
13:30.625 --> 13:31.945
Let's not speak of it again.

170
13:32.705 --> 13:35.425
What I asked you to do, is everything taken care of?

171
13:44.585 --> 13:46.225
I only hope we can cover this up.

172
13:51.345 --> 13:55.345
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

173
13:59.745 --> 14:01.385
My Lord, it's time to wash and dress.

174
14:02.185 --> 14:03.345
I'll do it.

175
14:05.945 --> 14:06.905
My Lord.

176
14:16.265 --> 14:18.065
Let me help you wash, My Lord.

177
14:33.905 --> 14:35.065
Thank you.

178
15:03.985 --> 15:04.825
My Lord.

179
15:04.905 --> 15:07.025
The Dowager Lady and your mother are here to see you.

180
15:16.065 --> 15:17.985
Grandmother. Mother.

181
15:21.665 --> 15:24.505
Zhuo. Are you feeling better today?

182
15:25.985 --> 15:28.425
Grandmother, my wounds have fully healed.

183
15:28.505 --> 15:29.545
Look.

184
15:32.225 --> 15:33.105
Actually…

185
15:40.585 --> 15:42.425
Grandmother, let me help you to your seat.

186
15:46.185 --> 15:47.465
I've always been strong.

187
15:47.985 --> 15:49.625
I've been in bed for over a month.

188
15:49.705 --> 15:51.065
I can't stand lying around any longer.

189
15:51.665 --> 15:54.105
Besides, at court I still have urgent duties to attend to.

190
15:55.105 --> 15:57.785
Nothing, no matter how urgent, is more important than your life.

191
15:57.865 --> 16:00.665
Unless Physician Zhao personally vouches for you,

192
16:00.745 --> 16:04.465
none of your military colleagues, not even that young General Qi,

193
16:04.545 --> 16:06.705
are allowed through this door.

194
16:07.785 --> 16:13.305
Zhuo, back then, your father left his mother and all of us behind.

195
16:13.385 --> 16:16.785
If anything happens to you now,

196
16:17.305 --> 16:20.185
I'll have nothing left to live for.

197
16:21.065 --> 16:23.585
I might as well hang myself

198
16:24.105 --> 16:25.945
so I won't have to see it,

199
16:26.025 --> 16:30.745
rather than spend the rest of my days drowning in grief.

200
16:32.745 --> 16:36.865
Fate brought you into our family to live in constant fear.

201
16:36.945 --> 16:39.185
Such is the fate your mother and I share.

202
16:39.865 --> 16:41.865
But look at her.

203
16:41.945 --> 16:43.425
She's only been here a few days,

204
16:44.105 --> 16:46.625
yet she's been running herself ragged for you.

205
16:46.705 --> 16:48.665
If you cared about her at all,

206
16:48.745 --> 16:52.185
you wouldn't say something so heartless.

207
16:55.505 --> 16:56.865
Dowager Lady.

208
16:57.585 --> 16:59.665
Governess Wu, who came here with the lady,

209
16:59.745 --> 17:01.545
has been missing since yesterday.

210
17:02.065 --> 17:03.905
We sent every servant in the courtyard to look,

211
17:03.985 --> 17:04.985
but there's still no sign of her.

212
17:05.665 --> 17:09.785
I just searched her room and found all her money and valuables gone.

213
17:13.065 --> 17:14.145
Grandmother.

214
17:15.265 --> 17:16.345
Before I married,

215
17:16.865 --> 17:19.105
my aunt feared I was too young to manage a household,

216
17:19.985 --> 17:22.305
so she sent one of her most trusted governess to come with me.

217
17:23.184 --> 17:27.145
I failed to keep her in line, and this happened.

218
17:28.305 --> 17:29.385
-Dowager Lady. -Bitao.

219
17:31.185 --> 17:32.145
Let her speak.

220
17:34.905 --> 17:36.385
My Lady, why cover for her?

221
17:37.065 --> 17:38.865
That woman knew she was sent by your elder

222
17:38.945 --> 17:40.665
and never showed you any respect.

223
17:41.265 --> 17:43.305
She drank, gambled, and shirked her duties all day.

224
17:43.385 --> 17:44.905
She even stole your lotus seed soup every day.

225
17:45.665 --> 17:47.505
When I caught her and scolded her,

226
17:47.585 --> 17:49.585
she got angry and threatened to go home.

227
17:49.665 --> 17:52.345
Yesterday was the servants' day off,

228
17:52.425 --> 17:54.105
so countless servants came and went through the back gate.

229
17:54.185 --> 17:57.305
And the pass our courtyard uses for errands just happened to go missing.

230
17:57.385 --> 17:58.745
-Maybe she slipped out in the chaos… -Bitao.

231
17:58.825 --> 18:01.185
Governess Wu would never break the rules like that.

232
18:01.265 --> 18:02.545
Don't make baseless accusations.

233
18:03.665 --> 18:05.025
How could this be your fault?

234
18:05.625 --> 18:07.545
Old servants in great households

235
18:07.625 --> 18:11.105
bully those below them and flatter those above.

236
18:11.185 --> 18:14.785
If you're too strict with them, they'll resent you.

237
18:14.865 --> 18:16.225
But if you're too lenient,

238
18:17.105 --> 18:20.585
they'll only take advantage of you more.

239
18:22.465 --> 18:24.145
If she's gone, let her go.

240
18:24.225 --> 18:26.025
Tomorrow, have Governess Miao

241
18:26.105 --> 18:29.185
pick a few truly capable servants for you.

242
18:30.425 --> 18:31.665
Thank you, Grandmother.

243
18:32.625 --> 18:35.705
Come to think of it, this is really my fault.

244
18:36.305 --> 18:37.665
When His Lordship woke,

245
18:37.745 --> 18:40.865
Governess Wu asked twice to return to the Wei Residence with the good news.

246
18:40.945 --> 18:43.225
But I refused her both times.

247
18:43.305 --> 18:45.945
Had I asked the Dowager Lady sooner and received permission for her to leave,

248
18:46.025 --> 18:49.345
perhaps My Lady could've been spared all this distress.

249
18:51.145 --> 18:52.465
So that's what happened.

250
18:53.985 --> 18:54.865
Grandmother.

251
18:55.985 --> 18:57.505
It's tradition for newlyweds to visit her family on the third day.

252
18:58.625 --> 18:59.905
My illness delayed that visit again and again.

253
19:00.545 --> 19:02.505
Ever since my wife married into this family,

254
19:02.585 --> 19:03.665
she's barely rested while caring for me.

255
19:04.665 --> 19:06.105
That's why I've finally recovered.

256
19:06.705 --> 19:08.345
Now that I'm well,

257
19:08.425 --> 19:09.665
I should take my wife

258
19:09.745 --> 19:11.465
to the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence to pay our respects.

259
19:11.985 --> 19:13.225
It's only proper as their grandson-in-law.

260
19:14.905 --> 19:16.305
I've long heard

261
19:16.985 --> 19:19.945
my wife was raised by Old Madam Wei herself.

262
19:20.545 --> 19:21.545
They're very close,

263
19:22.345 --> 19:23.425
and deeply attached to each other.

264
19:24.585 --> 19:26.625
Rao is a devoted granddaughter.

265
19:27.225 --> 19:28.425
She's been away from home so long.

266
19:28.945 --> 19:32.785
She must miss her grandmother and be eager to visit her family.

267
19:32.865 --> 19:33.705
I…

268
19:45.825 --> 19:46.945
As my lord wishes.

269
19:50.145 --> 19:54.105
I can tell you're just looking for any way to get out.

270
19:54.865 --> 19:55.945
All right, then.

271
19:56.025 --> 19:58.585
You'll visit the Wei family in seven days.

272
19:59.545 --> 20:02.465
Send word to the Wei Residence.

273
20:02.545 --> 20:06.545
Zhuo, though I've allowed you to go out,

274
20:06.625 --> 20:08.785
don't overdo it.

275
20:08.865 --> 20:10.425
Your health comes first.

276
20:11.745 --> 20:12.745
Yes, Grandmother.

277
20:29.505 --> 20:33.545
Grandmother, you've been so worried lately that you've lost quite a bit of weight.

278
20:33.625 --> 20:36.865
I've been terribly worried about you, so I made these pastries myself

279
20:37.465 --> 20:38.385
and added some honey.

280
20:38.465 --> 20:40.265
The crust is nice and crisp. Try one.

281
20:52.745 --> 20:54.985
You're very thoughtful.

282
20:56.105 --> 21:00.025
But we haven't heard from Rao in days.

283
21:00.665 --> 21:04.585
I don't even know how her husband, Lord Lu, is doing.

284
21:05.105 --> 21:08.585
How can I not worry?

285
21:09.105 --> 21:11.585
Mother, don't worry.

286
21:12.225 --> 21:14.505
Lord Lu may be gravely ill,

287
21:14.585 --> 21:18.465
but our Rao has always been blessed with good fortune.

288
21:18.545 --> 21:23.025
Remember how that lost pearl found its way back to us?

289
21:23.105 --> 21:24.745
No matter how grave his illness,

290
21:24.825 --> 21:26.985
Rao's marriage was meant to ward off his bad luck.

291
21:27.065 --> 21:28.905
Surely he'll recover.

292
21:28.985 --> 21:32.785
The Lu family hasn't sent any news,

293
21:32.865 --> 21:35.705
but that may actually be a good sign.

294
21:35.785 --> 21:38.945
Yufeng, stop trying to comfort Mother.

295
21:39.025 --> 21:42.065
Every physician said he's beyond saving.

296
21:42.665 --> 21:46.185
They said he wouldn't make it past the end of the month.

297
21:46.265 --> 21:50.305
When I woke up this morning, my eyelid wouldn't stop twitching.

298
21:50.905 --> 21:54.825
I suspect the bad news will come within a day or two.

299
21:54.905 --> 21:57.105
We should all prepare ourselves.

300
21:57.865 --> 21:59.185
Silence!

301
21:59.265 --> 22:01.425
If your cursed tongue proves right

302
22:02.105 --> 22:03.905
and my Rao truly becomes a widow,

303
22:03.985 --> 22:06.505
I'll make you pay with your life!

304
22:08.865 --> 22:12.425
Dowager Lady! Wonderful news! Great news!

305
22:14.025 --> 22:16.785
Congratulations, Dowager Lady! The Lu family sent word.

306
22:16.865 --> 22:18.625
Lord Lu has finally recovered.

307
22:18.705 --> 22:22.505
He'll soon bring the Lady Rao back home for a visit.

308
22:23.105 --> 22:24.505
-Really? -It's true.

309
22:25.185 --> 22:26.025
What did you say?

310
22:26.105 --> 22:27.705
-Say that again! -Wonderful! Wonderful!

311
22:27.785 --> 22:28.745
He survived! He survived!

312
22:29.345 --> 22:31.985
Heaven spared Lord Lu and brought him back from the brink.

313
22:32.065 --> 22:33.385
He's alive!

314
22:35.825 --> 22:38.625
Good! Good! Wonderful!

315
22:40.145 --> 22:41.385
Congratulations, Mother.

316
22:41.465 --> 22:43.665
Why am I suddenly hungry?

317
22:44.265 --> 22:45.265
Die!

318
22:45.345 --> 22:46.425
Lady Rao…

319
22:46.505 --> 22:47.945
You should all die!

320
22:48.505 --> 22:51.065
-Why won't you die? You should all die! -Lady Rao…

321
22:52.265 --> 22:53.505
All of you should die!

322
22:53.585 --> 22:54.945
THE JADE BOUGH FALLS

323
22:55.025 --> 22:56.825
Every last one of you should die!

324
22:56.905 --> 22:59.105
Just die! All of you!

325
23:00.745 --> 23:01.665
Rao.

326
23:04.425 --> 23:05.705
Are you all right?

327
23:05.785 --> 23:06.625
Did you hurt yourself?

328
23:07.745 --> 23:08.785
Good heavens!

329
23:10.625 --> 23:11.625
All of you, leave us.

330
23:14.665 --> 23:15.545
Yes.

331
23:18.785 --> 23:19.985
Look at your hand.

332
23:20.065 --> 23:21.385
Even if you're angry with a servant,

333
23:21.465 --> 23:23.425
you can't hurt yourself like this.

334
23:23.505 --> 23:24.505
Aunt.

335
23:25.105 --> 23:26.545
Lu Zhuo isn't dead.

336
23:27.185 --> 23:28.825
He actually survived.

337
23:30.345 --> 23:32.025
Why didn't he die?

338
23:32.545 --> 23:34.225
He was supposed to die!

339
23:35.185 --> 23:38.265
He should've rotted away in the filth, his flesh and bones decaying!

340
23:39.985 --> 23:41.345
If he lives,

341
23:41.425 --> 23:43.625
then haven't I outsmarted myself

342
23:44.225 --> 23:47.945
and handed all the wealth and honor of being his wife to someone else?

343
23:49.825 --> 23:51.785
A lowly woman,

344
23:53.825 --> 23:56.465
someone who emptied chamber pots from house to house,

345
23:57.065 --> 23:59.425
has suddenly transformed

346
24:00.225 --> 24:04.105
into the rightful wife of Lord Lu.

347
24:07.265 --> 24:08.385
What a joke.

348
24:10.385 --> 24:13.385
Why? Why!

349
24:13.465 --> 24:14.865
Rao, calm down!

350
24:16.105 --> 24:17.625
I know how wronged you feel.

351
24:17.705 --> 24:19.745
This is all Lu Zhuo's fault.

352
24:20.265 --> 24:22.825
He was supposed to die, but didn't, and that's what caused this whole mess.

353
24:22.905 --> 24:25.585
I'll go to the Lu family right now and show them

354
24:25.665 --> 24:27.345
who the Wei family's true jewel is,

355
24:27.425 --> 24:28.785
and who should be Lord Lu's wife!

356
24:28.865 --> 24:30.385
You absolutely can't!

357
24:30.465 --> 24:31.745
Think about it.

358
24:32.425 --> 24:34.265
When Lu Zhuo was gravely ill and near death,

359
24:34.345 --> 24:35.705
the Lu family even reported it to the Empress Dowager.

360
24:36.305 --> 24:39.105
They welcomed the bride into the family with great ceremony.

361
24:39.185 --> 24:41.465
Everyone believes the wedding cured a dying man,

362
24:41.545 --> 24:43.025
and praises her as a woman blessed with good fortune.

363
24:43.705 --> 24:46.065
If you go to the Lu family now,

364
24:46.145 --> 24:49.305
they'll learn that our Wei family switched the brides

365
24:49.905 --> 24:51.745
and dared marry a lowborn girl to their heir.

366
24:51.825 --> 24:53.265
Of course they'd be furious.

367
24:53.865 --> 24:57.385
Our families would become bitter enemies, and the marriage still couldn't be undone.

368
24:57.985 --> 24:58.825
Even…

369
24:59.705 --> 25:01.505
Even if your grandmother learned the truth,

370
25:01.585 --> 25:02.985
I'm afraid she wouldn't forgive you either.

371
25:09.625 --> 25:13.665
Aunt, are you saying I should just swallow this humiliation

372
25:14.465 --> 25:17.025
and let someone else take my name and husband?

373
25:18.625 --> 25:22.105
Am I to hide at this hot spring estate forever, living as a shadow?

374
25:22.785 --> 25:24.105
I'd rather die!

375
25:24.185 --> 25:25.385
Rao!

376
25:26.505 --> 25:27.625
Calm down.

377
25:28.265 --> 25:30.145
I've already thought everything through.

378
25:30.745 --> 25:33.505
Pack your things at once.

379
25:33.585 --> 25:34.545
Come back to the residence with me in secret.

380
25:35.785 --> 25:37.265
When she returns to visit her family,

381
25:37.345 --> 25:39.385
I'll have everything arranged.

382
25:41.705 --> 25:42.745
You mean…

383
25:42.825 --> 25:45.265
When that wretched maid comes back,

384
25:45.345 --> 25:48.465
I'll set everything right and undo this whole mess.

385
25:48.545 --> 25:51.025
You'll take your rightful place as Lord Lu's wife.

386
25:54.625 --> 25:55.745
I knew it.

387
25:57.465 --> 25:59.305
You're always the best to me, Aunt.

388
25:59.385 --> 26:01.545
I know how much you've suffered.

389
26:03.025 --> 26:06.065
Later, I'll personally help you get ready.

390
26:17.145 --> 26:18.025
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

391
26:18.105 --> 26:21.625
Your wife went to see the Dowager Lady early this morning.

392
26:21.705 --> 26:24.705
I suppose she kept her a little longer with some last-minute advice.

393
26:25.305 --> 26:27.145
So don't look upset when she arrives.

394
26:27.225 --> 26:29.585
Mother, I won't.

395
26:31.145 --> 26:32.505
My Lord, you've only just recovered.

396
26:32.585 --> 26:33.785
You really shouldn't be going out yet.

397
26:33.865 --> 26:36.545
While you're out, you mustn't get chilled or catch a draft.

398
26:36.625 --> 26:38.785
And you shouldn't drink at the banquet.

399
26:38.865 --> 26:41.705
Alcohol will stir up your blood and could seriously harm your health.

400
26:42.305 --> 26:43.545
Enough.

401
26:47.825 --> 26:49.825
WANXIANG HALL

402
27:04.785 --> 27:07.905
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

403
27:07.985 --> 27:09.505
The Dowager Lady kept me for a while.

404
27:09.585 --> 27:11.625
Sorry to keep you waiting, Mother, My Lord.

405
27:12.745 --> 27:13.625
Rao.

406
27:13.705 --> 27:16.145
You dressed so plainly while Lu Zhuo was ill.

407
27:16.225 --> 27:19.145
Today you look especially bright and festive.

408
27:19.225 --> 27:21.505
It's such a joy to see.

409
27:22.545 --> 27:23.905
No need to delay.

410
27:24.905 --> 27:25.745
Let's go.

411
27:32.065 --> 27:34.145
Zhuo, you've only just recovered from a serious illness.

412
27:34.225 --> 27:35.625
You're still weak and short of strength.

413
27:36.225 --> 27:38.185
Don't ride today.

414
27:39.425 --> 27:41.425
Ride in the carriage with your wife.

415
27:43.665 --> 27:44.705
No need.

416
27:48.745 --> 27:50.105
My heart…

417
27:53.385 --> 27:54.825
Mother has a point.

418
27:55.665 --> 27:56.985
I'll do as you say.

419
27:58.345 --> 28:01.585
Go on. Come back early.

420
28:24.345 --> 28:25.585
Thank you, My Lord.

421
28:42.705 --> 28:43.945
No need to see us off, Mother.

422
28:44.025 --> 28:45.305
Please go back inside.

423
29:59.705 --> 30:02.545
Her hands are covered in calluses and scars.

424
30:02.625 --> 30:04.505
No wonder she always wears gloves.

425
30:10.305 --> 30:12.905
My Lord, Jewelers' Lane is just ahead.

426
30:13.985 --> 30:16.185
You've cared for me so well and stayed by my side.

427
30:16.705 --> 30:17.705
I'd like to buy you some jewelry.

428
30:18.705 --> 30:19.865
I couldn't go out before.

429
30:20.465 --> 30:21.705
Today, you can pick whatever you like.

430
30:29.585 --> 30:33.225
My Lord, forgive me for not welcoming you sooner.

431
30:33.305 --> 30:35.185
My Lord, please come inside for some tea.

432
31:17.545 --> 31:18.625
Here.

433
31:18.705 --> 31:20.665
-I can't accept this. -Put it on.

434
31:22.905 --> 31:24.905
A fortune-teller said I lack water in my five elements.

435
31:24.985 --> 31:27.505
Gold creates water, so I should wear more gold.

436
31:28.385 --> 31:30.465
I never cared for such gaudy things before.

437
31:31.145 --> 31:33.025
But now I want to share my good fortune with His Lordship.

438
31:33.105 --> 31:35.505
So I'll have to wear much more from now on.

439
31:36.105 --> 31:38.785
Bitao, you serve me every day.

440
31:39.585 --> 31:42.105
Wearing gold can bring me luck too.

441
31:43.425 --> 31:45.705
You hear that? Bring out your finest pieces for My Lady.

442
31:45.785 --> 31:48.385
Yes. My Lady may choose anything she likes.

443
31:48.465 --> 31:50.865
The heavier the gold, the greater the blessing.

444
31:50.945 --> 31:53.865
For His Lordship's health, I suppose I'll have to bear the burden.

445
31:57.625 --> 31:58.385
Let's talk business.

446
32:01.865 --> 32:04.265
All right, all right. Business.

447
32:08.865 --> 32:11.225
Lady Wei Rao is quite amusing.

448
32:11.305 --> 32:13.785
I've been watching her manner, her speech and bearing.

449
32:13.865 --> 32:15.185
There's none of the shrewish temper we heard about.

450
32:15.265 --> 32:16.385
She's like a different person.

451
32:18.505 --> 32:20.225
Why not invite my new sister-in-law in?

452
32:20.305 --> 32:21.225
I'd like to meet her.

453
32:24.025 --> 32:24.865
Business first.

454
32:30.065 --> 32:33.025
That day, only after we beheaded Xiahou Xian, Hutuo's Left Wudu Marquis,

455
32:33.545 --> 32:34.785
did our army narrowly win.

456
32:35.385 --> 32:38.705
But on the night of my surprise attack, how was the plan leaked?

457
32:40.665 --> 32:41.545
Did you find out?

458
32:42.145 --> 32:43.545
You suspect…

459
32:45.145 --> 32:46.625
No. That's impossible.

460
32:46.705 --> 32:48.465
Besides us,

461
32:48.545 --> 32:50.305
only a handful in the army knew about the surprise attack.

462
32:51.105 --> 32:52.865
They were either supervisors trusted by His Majesty

463
32:52.945 --> 32:54.785
or battle-hardened generals.

464
32:55.385 --> 32:59.345
You think they secretly colluded with Hutuo and leaked vital intelligence?

465
32:59.425 --> 33:00.625
How could that be possible?

466
33:01.185 --> 33:03.625
Lu Zhuo, you're being far too suspicious.

467
33:04.225 --> 33:08.105
Am I really too suspicious, or is someone secretly aiding the enemy?

468
33:10.265 --> 33:12.625
-There's only one way to find out. -How?

469
33:16.425 --> 33:18.665
I'm making a grand visit to my wife's family today.

470
33:18.745 --> 33:21.585
Soon all of the capital will know I'm still alive.

471
33:22.865 --> 33:24.345
Just spread the rumor

472
33:25.305 --> 33:29.065
that I seized a secret letter from the enemy camp.

473
33:46.985 --> 33:51.025
To pray for your good health, My Lord, I had no choice.

474
33:51.625 --> 33:52.465
How gaudy.

475
34:01.145 --> 34:02.185
You…

476
34:04.425 --> 34:05.545
What are you doing?

477
34:06.665 --> 34:08.545
I picked all of these with great care.

478
34:10.304 --> 34:11.744
These would look beautiful in my hair.

479
34:13.065 --> 34:14.744
We'll keep this one.

480
34:33.385 --> 34:34.784
Excellent choice, My Lord.

481
34:34.865 --> 34:36.705
This gold hairpin is exquisitely crafted.

482
34:37.465 --> 34:38.905
It's extremely rare.

483
34:38.985 --> 34:41.304
You won't find another like it in the city.

484
34:41.385 --> 34:44.025
I was hoping to keep some for myself for the future.

485
34:44.545 --> 34:45.705
Now all my planning was for nothing.

486
34:46.225 --> 34:47.145
So stingy.

487
34:51.105 --> 34:53.505
Send everything else to the Duke's Residence.

488
34:55.185 --> 34:56.264
Yes. Yes.

489
34:56.344 --> 34:57.185
Why aren't you leaving?

490
35:04.065 --> 35:05.025
My Lady.

491
35:09.825 --> 35:11.785
Farewell, My Lord.

492
35:23.065 --> 35:26.025
Don't we still have that gold necklace set with sapphires?

493
35:26.665 --> 35:27.825
Send that to her too.

494
35:28.745 --> 35:30.105
Yes, yes.

495
35:30.185 --> 35:31.665
It's so heavy.

496
35:31.745 --> 35:34.105
I hope it doesn't snap her slender neck.

497
35:34.745 --> 35:40.545
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

498
35:45.865 --> 35:47.145
You're home. That's what matters.

499
35:49.345 --> 35:51.025
That's all that matters.

500
35:59.345 --> 36:01.345
My Rao is home.

501
36:02.665 --> 36:04.225
I'm so glad you're back.

502
36:06.385 --> 36:09.585
Ever since you married, your grandmother has missed you every day.

503
36:09.665 --> 36:10.585
LOTUS ROOM

504
36:10.665 --> 36:12.385
She often cries when no one's looking.

505
36:12.985 --> 36:15.905
Her eyesight has worsened lately too.

506
36:16.505 --> 36:18.145
She's taking medicine for it.

507
36:18.985 --> 36:19.865
I've been a poor granddaughter.

508
36:19.945 --> 36:20.825
I made you worry.

509
36:20.905 --> 36:24.785
Rao, get up. Please, get up.

510
36:26.105 --> 36:28.265
-Mother. -Rao…

511
36:28.345 --> 36:30.025
Let me help you sit down first.

512
36:30.105 --> 36:31.665
Don't be sad.

513
36:32.945 --> 36:34.145
Here. Easy now.

514
36:44.305 --> 36:45.665
Mother.

515
36:45.745 --> 36:49.065
On such a happy day, and with honored guests here,

516
36:49.825 --> 36:52.185
you really shouldn't cry.

517
36:53.345 --> 36:54.225
We're all family.

518
36:54.305 --> 36:56.105
There's no need to be so formal.

519
36:57.425 --> 36:58.265
From now on,

520
36:58.345 --> 37:00.185
I'll bring my wife back often to visit you.

521
37:01.185 --> 37:03.385
I hope you won't mind having us around so much.

522
37:04.025 --> 37:06.745
I'd be happier if you stayed a few days.

523
37:08.065 --> 37:10.825
Begonia Court is always ready for you.

524
37:11.425 --> 37:14.785
Everything inside has been left just as it was.

525
37:14.865 --> 37:18.105
It's carefully cleaned every day.

526
37:27.865 --> 37:29.945
ORCHID ROOM

527
37:41.545 --> 37:42.505
Dowager Lady.

528
37:42.585 --> 37:44.905
Lord Lu is invited to the front hall.

529
37:44.985 --> 37:46.225
All the guests have arrived.

530
37:51.305 --> 37:53.865
Lord Lu, are you feeling unwell?

531
37:55.105 --> 37:55.945
I felt fine when we left.

532
37:56.545 --> 37:58.545
But I went to Jewelers' Lane with Rao earlier.

533
38:00.225 --> 38:01.625
Perhaps I overexerted myself.

534
38:02.145 --> 38:03.145
I'm sure it's nothing serious.

535
38:04.865 --> 38:07.465
Rao, come here. Come.

536
38:09.585 --> 38:10.425
Come.

537
38:12.945 --> 38:15.465
He's only just recovered from a serious illness.

538
38:15.545 --> 38:18.545
You shouldn't have made him come all this way.

539
38:18.625 --> 38:22.385
All this traveling must have exhausted him.

540
38:22.465 --> 38:25.425
Someone recovering from a long illness shouldn't talk too much.

541
38:26.105 --> 38:27.385
It drains his strength.

542
38:27.985 --> 38:32.185
And I'm afraid some thoughtless guests may even pressure him to drink.

543
38:33.305 --> 38:35.945
Skip the banquet.

544
38:36.545 --> 38:39.465
Rest in Rao's room instead.

545
38:40.145 --> 38:41.145
That way,

546
38:41.225 --> 38:44.265
I can spend more time talking with her too.

547
38:44.345 --> 38:46.265
I am feeling a little tired.

548
38:47.305 --> 38:48.905
Thank you for your consideration, Old Madam Wei.

549
38:49.625 --> 38:52.745
Good, good. Take Lord Lu to Rao's room.

550
38:53.345 --> 38:56.505
Make sure he's well looked after.

551
39:03.145 --> 39:04.305
Grandmother.

552
39:04.385 --> 39:05.665
Have some tea.

553
39:10.305 --> 39:11.465
I was careless.

554
39:11.545 --> 39:13.025
-It's fine. -Why are you so careless?

555
39:13.105 --> 39:13.945
Always so clumsy.

556
39:17.265 --> 39:19.385
Quick, let me see. Did you burn yourself?

557
39:19.985 --> 39:22.505
No, I'm fine.

558
39:23.705 --> 39:26.745
Rao, being the wife of the family heir isn't easy.

559
39:26.825 --> 39:29.905
You must carry yourself with more dignity from now on.

560
39:29.985 --> 39:33.585
Come. Let's go inside and get you cleaned up.

561
39:35.065 --> 39:38.305
Mother, why don't I go with you?

562
39:39.225 --> 39:42.425
I want some private time with Rao.

563
39:42.505 --> 39:44.185
Do you have to come in and bother us too?

564
39:45.385 --> 39:46.745
Go away. Come.

565
39:48.785 --> 39:49.625
Rao.

566
39:51.745 --> 39:53.185
Take good care of Grandmother.

567
39:54.945 --> 39:55.945
Yes.

568
39:56.025 --> 39:57.985
Rao, come on.

569
40:05.385 --> 40:07.945
She comes from such a humble family after all.

570
40:08.745 --> 40:11.625
Look how timid she is.

571
40:12.145 --> 40:14.545
She'd never dare stand against you.

572
40:14.625 --> 40:16.225
But you…

573
40:17.625 --> 40:21.425
If you lose your composure, you'll only give yourself away.

574
40:22.265 --> 40:24.265
No need to say more, Yufeng.

575
40:24.345 --> 40:26.025
I know what I'm doing.

576
40:28.345 --> 40:32.265
ORCHID ROOM

577
40:36.545 --> 40:38.465
This is Lady Rao's room.

578
40:45.105 --> 40:46.665
I'd like to rest alone for a while.

579
40:47.745 --> 40:48.945
You may all leave.

580
41:11.425 --> 41:12.545
That scent…

581
41:21.025 --> 41:22.265
You may all leave.

582
41:35.105 --> 41:37.705
Grandmother, is there something you want to tell me?

583
41:45.585 --> 41:46.625
Open it and see.

584
41:49.945 --> 41:52.785
These are the farmlands and deeds

585
41:52.865 --> 41:57.185
your father left you years ago.

586
41:57.265 --> 42:00.785
And over a dozen shops on the streets near Anshang Gate

587
42:00.865 --> 42:02.745
and Hanguang Gate.

588
42:02.825 --> 42:03.665
And there's more.

589
42:03.745 --> 42:07.585
Over the years, I've saved some private money for you.

590
42:08.785 --> 42:10.425
Keep it all safe.

591
42:16.065 --> 42:17.305
I already have my dowry.

592
42:17.385 --> 42:19.945
Please keep these for yourself.

593
42:20.025 --> 42:24.025
Silly child, everyone knows what's in your dowry.

594
42:24.105 --> 42:26.585
You can't use it freely.

595
42:27.825 --> 42:31.505
Your mother-in-law rarely manages the household.

596
42:31.585 --> 42:34.345
The second branch runs the Duke's Residence,

597
42:34.425 --> 42:37.625
so they'll inevitably have some control over you.

598
42:38.225 --> 42:39.545
With these,

599
42:40.185 --> 42:42.265
you can live your own life

600
42:42.345 --> 42:45.545
without depending on your husband for everything,

601
42:45.625 --> 42:49.305
or asking the household for every expense.

602
42:49.985 --> 42:53.345
You can spend it however you like.

603
42:53.425 --> 42:56.105
You'll have much more freedom.

604
42:56.625 --> 42:57.785
Rao,

605
42:59.225 --> 43:01.825
I forced you into this marriage.

606
43:02.345 --> 43:04.505
I truly wronged you.

607
43:05.505 --> 43:09.025
And I've wronged my son who died so young.

608
43:09.625 --> 43:11.065
You are

609
43:11.585 --> 43:16.705
the only child he left in this world.

610
43:23.025 --> 43:25.105
Lady Rao, the floor is cold.

611
43:25.705 --> 43:29.785
Rao, get up. Please, get up.

612
43:29.865 --> 43:31.385
The floor is cold.

613
43:49.665 --> 43:50.505
You…

614
44:08.865 --> 44:09.865
Mother.

615
44:16.465 --> 44:19.505
LOTUS ROOM

616
44:19.585 --> 44:24.345
Mother, what secret did you and your granddaughter have to discuss

617
44:24.425 --> 44:25.945
that you had to keep from both of us?

618
44:26.025 --> 44:30.585
I remembered your brother once gave me a jade pendant.

619
44:30.665 --> 44:33.385
It was just sitting in storage, unused all these years.

620
44:34.065 --> 44:39.425
So I gave it to Wei Rao as something to remember him by.

621
44:39.505 --> 44:40.945
Are you jealous even of that?

622
44:42.305 --> 44:44.345
And you're supposed to be her elder.

623
44:46.065 --> 44:48.065
Rao, look.

624
44:48.625 --> 44:51.785
Your grandmother really does adore you.

625
44:58.825 --> 45:00.145
Rao.

626
45:00.225 --> 45:02.585
Your cousin has deeply regretted

627
45:02.665 --> 45:05.185
always bickering with you before you married.

628
45:05.785 --> 45:07.785
She often says that without you,

629
45:07.865 --> 45:10.145
the house feels much quieter.

630
45:10.225 --> 45:11.465
When she heard you were coming home,

631
45:12.065 --> 45:15.505
she personally prepared a gift for you and your husband.

632
45:17.225 --> 45:19.425
She strung these pearls herself.

633
45:19.505 --> 45:23.145
They aren't worth much, but they're a token of sisterly affection.

634
45:23.665 --> 45:27.625
Sadly, she caught a cold these past few days

635
45:27.705 --> 45:29.265
and can't give it to you herself.

636
45:29.345 --> 45:31.265
She's terribly upset about it.

637
45:32.425 --> 45:33.505
Thank you, Aunt.

638
45:33.585 --> 45:37.185
You two cousins have bickered since you were little.

639
45:37.265 --> 45:38.545
You've only been apart a few days,

640
45:38.625 --> 45:40.785
and that stubborn girl has already softened.

641
45:41.745 --> 45:44.225
Chan has always been proud.

642
45:44.305 --> 45:46.545
It's rare for her to make the first move.

643
45:47.065 --> 45:49.985
You really should go visit her at Orchid Court.

644
45:50.665 --> 45:54.105
It'll show there's no bad blood between you.

645
46:09.985 --> 46:11.385
Grandmother.

646
46:11.465 --> 46:13.265
Seeing you cousins get along

647
46:14.625 --> 46:18.225
puts my mind at ease. Go on.

648
46:20.585 --> 46:23.265
Then I'll come back and keep you company.

649
46:50.225 --> 46:51.665
Greetings, Lady Rao.

650
46:52.185 --> 46:54.185
Bitao, Chunyan sent word

651
46:54.265 --> 46:56.105
that Lord Lu finds the porcelain pillow too hard

652
46:56.185 --> 46:57.385
and the jade pillow too cold.

653
46:57.465 --> 46:59.145
My Lady had a pearl-filled silk pillow.

654
46:59.225 --> 47:00.745
Chunyan searched everywhere but couldn't find it.

655
47:00.825 --> 47:02.185
You used to keep all those things,

656
47:02.265 --> 47:04.065
so she asked if Bitao could help her look.

657
47:05.025 --> 47:07.745
Go take a look. Come back quickly.

658
47:09.665 --> 47:10.705
Yes.

659
47:20.585 --> 47:23.785
My Lady. Lady Chan was thrilled to hear you were coming.

660
47:23.865 --> 47:25.265
She sent me here especially to meet you.

661
47:26.985 --> 47:27.865
This way, please.

662
47:41.065 --> 47:44.425
A REFINED SPIRIT, A TRANQUIL MIND

663
47:54.345 --> 47:57.665
BOOK PAVILION

664
47:58.585 --> 48:01.185
Lady Chan is waiting inside. Please.

665
48:03.425 --> 48:04.905
Wasn't my third sister waiting at Orchid Court?

666
48:05.665 --> 48:07.185
Why is she here instead?

667
48:07.265 --> 48:08.905
Lady Chan has always loved books.

668
48:08.985 --> 48:10.545
Even when she's ill, she never puts them down.

669
48:10.625 --> 48:12.185
Don't you remember, My Lady?

670
48:12.265 --> 48:13.825
You'll see her once you go inside.

671
48:21.665 --> 48:22.785
Why did you lock me in?

672
48:23.385 --> 48:26.705
Open the door! Open it! Open the door!

673
48:26.785 --> 48:28.225
Open this door!

674
48:29.265 --> 48:31.345
Open the door! Open it!

675
48:37.465 --> 48:40.745
Open the door! Let me out!

676
48:41.585 --> 48:42.705
Open the door!

677
48:42.785 --> 48:45.145
You fool. All you had to do was tie her up.

678
48:45.225 --> 48:46.665
and quietly switch places with her.

679
48:46.745 --> 48:47.865
No one would've known.

680
48:48.545 --> 48:50.865
But you had to make a spectacle and bring lamp oil.

681
48:51.465 --> 48:52.625
Are you trying to draw everyone's attention?

682
48:52.705 --> 48:53.545
Open the door!

683
48:53.625 --> 48:55.025
Book Pavilion is secluded.

684
48:55.105 --> 48:56.825
-Somebody help! -Fires often break out here.

685
48:57.465 --> 48:59.345
If a maid burned to death, no one would think it strange.

686
49:00.465 --> 49:02.305
Aunt, you know me best.

687
49:02.385 --> 49:04.665
I've always been headstrong and ruthless.

688
49:04.745 --> 49:06.985
She's just a lowly woman who emptied chamber pots.

689
49:07.065 --> 49:09.105
How dare she take what's mine?

690
49:09.985 --> 49:12.145
-Open the door! -I want her dead without even a grave.

691
49:13.585 --> 49:14.425
Do it now.

692
49:15.625 --> 49:16.705
Give it to me.

693
49:27.265 --> 49:29.505
Open the door!

694
49:30.465 --> 49:32.505
Open the door!

695
49:40.785 --> 49:42.225
Help!

696
49:43.465 --> 49:44.865
Help!

697
49:44.945 --> 49:46.745
Help!

698
49:46.825 --> 49:48.985
Help!

699
49:50.505 --> 49:52.385
Somebody!

700
49:52.465 --> 49:55.425
Is anyone there? Help!

701
49:56.265 --> 49:58.265
Help!

702
52:11.865 --> 52:14.105
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
